Junior/Senior Business Electives (12 hours)
Maximum of 27 hours of ECON courses (major, elective).  More than 27 hours allowed if the extra courses are part of interdisciplinary minor.
A junior senior business elective is any 3000 or 4000 level business course (ACCT, BLAW, ECON, FINN, ISYS, MGMT, MKTG, SCMT, SEVI, h^/) except ECON 30503, ECON 30603, and MGMT 
35603.
